      "text": "S1Q3T3"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (S wave in lead I, Q wave and inverted T wave in lead III) or a new right bundle branch block may reflect sudden right ventricular enlargement; moderately specific but seen in only about 5% of patients."
     }
    ]
   },
